  "notes": "API methods bind to resources by ref, and the four DynamoDB CRUD actions accept inline, managed or AWS full-access forms on the Lambda role. Log-group checks cover only groups under /aws/lambda/, so an added API access-log group doesn't affect them. A stage hardcoded to dev can't be told apart from one taken from the parameter, because references resolve to defaults; environment_parameter checks the parameter separately. Real-output review (2026-11-10): all four real templates pass every core check; no change."
}
